flowchart TD
    Q[user query] --> SAN[sanitize -> MATCH]
    SAN --> RUN{run MATCH}
    RUN -->|ok| RANK[rank bm25 + snippet]
    RUN -->|syntax error| SAFE[fallback safe terms]
    RANK --> LOCAL[local results]
    LOCAL --> ONLINE{online?}
    ONLINE -->|yes| MERGE[merge remote Ch 10]
    ONLINE -->|no| DONE[local-only]
